WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.334
-I'm hanging out
with Kieran Culkin now.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.067
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:06.801
Kieran, the big thing that fans
love about "Succession" is

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:09.767
all of the iconic quotes,
insults, and one-liners

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:12.033
from you and your castmates,
so we wanted

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.467
to put your knowledge
to the test in a game we call

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:15.534
"Who Said It?"

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:16.634
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:18.767
-♪ Tell who said it ♪

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.901
♪ Tell me who said it, yeah ♪

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:22.767
-Alright, here we go.
Here's how it works.

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:25.400
I'm going to read you
real quotes from "Succession,"

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.033
could be any character
from any season,

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:28.701
and you have to tell me
who said it.

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:30.367
Sound okay?
-[ Blowing raspberry ]

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:31.901
[ Laughter ]
-Here we go.

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:33.567
Quote is...

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:43.534
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, that's good.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:44.634
Gerri?

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:46.901
No. Who is it?
-Let's see who said it.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.400
-Tom, you need to shut up.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.467
This isn't the time to get
your conscience out and shout,

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.400
"Hey, look at me.
I cannot tell a lie.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.501
I'm a good little boy.
Look at my ding-dong."
-There you go.

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:55.567
[ Ding ]
That's right. It is Gerri.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:56.634
[ Cheering and applause ]
That is correct.

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:59.467
[ Rimshot ]

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:01.968
Okay.
Here's this quote...

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:09.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:12.000
-Oh, wow, that's tough.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.467
Wow, that's good.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.067
Hugo?
I don't know.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:16.501
-Let's see who said it.

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:17.534
-You don't really hear much

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:19.834
-Oh!
-about syphilis, these days.

00:01:19.834 --> 00:01:22.834
Pretty much the --
the MySpace of STDs.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.534
-[ Laughs ] Very good delivery.
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:25.734
That was Tom!

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:27.033
[ The Roots play sad trombone ]

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.501
That was Tom. Am-wah.
Alright. Here we go.

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:29.567
Here's a quote here...

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.567
-Is there more?
-No.

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:39.133
-That's cousin Greg.
-Let's see.

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.567
-That's the one rule
on these things, man.

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.300
Teak deck?
No shoes.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.467
-Uh, what if --
what if your toenails

00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:48.267
are not all that
aesthetically pleasing?

00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:49.467
[ Ding ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:52.133
-You called it.
Good delivery.

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:53.801
-He's great.
-He's hilarious.

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:56.000
-Alright, but this quote.
Ready?
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.567
-I mean, that's like, I feel
like a carful of people,

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:03.801
but, yeah,
let's go with Kendall.

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.567
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.534
-Bad tweet!
-I got it, I got it, I got it!

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:08.567
Bad tweet!
-Kendall Roy

00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:09.934
is not a hero.
-Bad tweet!

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:11.601
[ Ding ]
-That's right. Correct!
-I watch the show!

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:14.100
[ Rimshot ]
-Correct!
-I watch it.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.167
-Alright.
Who said...?

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.901
Let's see right here.

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:25.400
-♪ Your friend
doesn't like you ♪

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.067
♪ Boo-hoo, boo-hoo ♪

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:28.701
♪ And Dad wants to fire you ♪

00:02:28.701 --> 00:02:29.767
♪ Woo-hoo, woo-hoo ♪

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:31.267
-That's right. Correct!
[ Ding ]

00:02:31.267 --> 00:02:32.834
[ Rimshot ]
Kieran Culkin, everybody!

00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:35.667
"Succession"
airs Sunday nights on HBO.

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.434
You can check Kieran out
tomorrow night

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:40.601
on "Saturday Night Live"
with Ed Sheeran.

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:41.868
[ Cheering and applause ]
Congratulations.

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.534
More "Tonight Show"
after the break, everybody.

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:45.300
Break a leg!
-Thank you.

